  "notes": [
    "Anchor: the attacker EOA 0x0ef50be2 deployed helpers and a first attack contract 0xa23078a0 whose call reverted (0xd3ef535e, block 7961769), then contract 0x3863bdec, whose first call 0xf7ab06fa (block 7961802) is the earliest successful mint; the DeFiHackLabs tx 0x765de835 is one of the 87 later calls to its second contract 0xb9b0090a (13 went through 0x3863bdec) (last 0x6573d062, block 7962691). The 0x3a4b66f1 calls (0.001 BNB) are the helpers' dust deposits into the vault.",
    "campaign.mjs over blocks 7906245-7990000 lists 117 mintFor exercises: 16 earlier ones are ordinary vault reward claims minting at most 24 HUNNY, 100 are the attacker's transactions, and one later ordinary claim (0xa3154f07); no other exercise moves material value.",
    "Reset: HunnyMinter 0x109ea28d was deployed on 2021-06-01 (0x870e6914), received HUNNY ownership (which isMinter requires) in 0xfd8e5985 and, later, the minter grant for CakeFlipVault in setMinter(0x12180bb3, true) 0xeddd70e1 (_minters slot 20), which the anchor's route needed; that mint grant is the latest relevant change (rule 8). The vault itself (created 0xa973261e with the minter pointer in its constructor) carries no defect. setOracle (0x4905caa9) and setPerformanceFee (0x1640b9bf) do not create the defect; slot 0xe changed by 0xa3528c2d is the lottery mint's last-block accumulator.",
    "Loss is the HUNNY/WBNB pair 0x36118142's net WBNB outflow per transaction over the anchor and campaign (loss.mjs --victims 0x36118142): 295.60 WBNB, net of the WBNB the minter itself swapped and added into the pair from the attacker's donated CAKE in the same transactions. The attacker EOA's own BNB balance rose by 292.33 BNB across the 100 transactions, consistent with that figure. Minted HUNNY is valued at what its sale realised (rule 12)."
  ]
